    "abstract": "Parts figure for the multi-mode receiver installation, showing the data concentrator, the mounting tray in both routing standards and the antenna feed retention along the rack.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure shows the multi-mode receiver installation in the forward avionics bay, with the data concentrator, the mounting tray and the antenna feed retention.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the rack looking forward. Items 20 and 20A are the mounting tray standards; the tray at item 20 carries the additional feed-through grommet needed for the rerouted antenna feed and is the only tray that may be fitted with the aligned navigation database. The data concentrator at item 10 is unchanged between standards and is shown for position only."
    },
